{"title":"1999 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video(By_YippieMath)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video(By YippieMath)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Which triplet of numbers has a sum NOT equal to 1?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/0/3c09ddfe9d8b9dfbfee744671951ef7621355b6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ (1/2,1/3,1/6) \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ (2,-2,1) \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ (0.1,0.3,0.6) \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ (1.1,-2.1,1.0) \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ (-3/2,-5/2,5)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"804\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>By adding each triplet, we can see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/e/8de641a309fc5878c26baf699f2382b7d4b02b5e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{(D)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"41\" height=\"29\" /> gives us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, not <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, as our sum.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video.28By_YippieMath.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video(By_YippieMath)\">Video(By YippieMath)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video(By YippieMath)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nMNIR7PfsG0&amp;t=15s\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nMNIR7PfsG0&amp;t=15s</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b>